Counter.scala: A simple example of a counter using synchronized blocks. 

StripedCounterArray.scala: An array of counters, protected using striped
locking.

MonitorTotalQueue.scala: A total queue.

MonitorShardedSet: A sharded set implemented using a monitor.

Lock.scala: An implementation of a lock, with conditions.

JVMMonitorPartialQueue.scala: A partial queue.

JVMMonitorBoundedPartialQueue.scala: A bounded partial queue.

JVMMonitorSyncChan.scala: A synchronous channel. 

JVMMonitorBarrier.scala: Barrier synchronisation.

TimeoutExchanger.scala: An exchanger with a timeout.

EXERCISES
=========

Mod3M.scala: The mod-3 lock.

JVMMonitorShardedMap.scala: A Sharded map.

HeapBarrier.scala: Barrier synchronisation objects, implemented using a heap
and lightweight signalling objects.

JVMMonitorBoundedPartialStack.scala: A bounded partial stack. 